arred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-19T21:44:07Z","updated_at":"2025-08-19T21:44:07Z","body":"> It might be worth checking out if this isn't accidentally some race condition related to loading behavior.\n\nHow can I confirm whether it's due to a race condition? Maybe I can build with `NO_THREADS` locally like on the web platform (it should work on desktop platforms nowadays), not sure if this will suffice.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3202335058/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3203305342","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109177#issuecomment-3203305342","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109177","id":3203305342,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6-7o9-","user":{"login":"DarioSamo","id":538504,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzODUwNA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/538504?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo","html_url":"https://github.com/DarioSamo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-20T00:11:08Z","updated_at":"2025-08-20T00:11:51Z","body":"> How can I confirm whether it's due to a race condition? Maybe I can build with `NO_THREADS` locally like on the web platform (it should work on desktop platforms nowadays), not sure if this will suffice.\n\nIt might be hard to track down, but knowing whether you can reproduce the issue consistently when reducing the project to its bare minimum might be a start. In my case, if I do that, the sphere always shows on its default color (green) no matter how I export it (but I'll repeat the tests regardless later to make sure).","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3203305342/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3206226020","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109177#issuecomment-3206226020","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109177","id":3206226020,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6_GyBk","user":{"login":"DarioSamo","id":538504,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzODUwNA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/538504?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo","html_url":"https://github.com/DarioSamo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-20T12:56:22Z","updated_at":"2025-08-20T12:56:22Z","body":"I can confirm one thing: it wasn't because of a race condition but rather, it's that if the wrong version of the related file gets cached into the 'exported' folder, that's the behavior that can consistently happen afterwards.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3206226020/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3206853706","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109177#issuecomment-3206853706","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109177","id":3206853706,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6_JLRK","user":{"login":"DarioSamo","id":538504,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzODUwNA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/538504?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo","html_url":"https://github.com/DarioSamo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-20T15:19:25Z","updated_at":"2025-08-20T15:19:25Z","body":"> I bisected the regression to [5a30a7e](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/commit/5a30a7e7cd5d5f0f8cb019d4765a46219ecf8e56). cc [@DarioSamo](https://github.com/DarioSamo)\n\nI tested the commit before this and it still breaks on headless mode. I'd try again but make sure to delete the 'exported' folder before doing this, as Godot will cache the result of a previous export that worked fine there.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3206853706/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3206894891","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109177#issuecomment-3206894891","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109177","id":3206894891,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6_JVUr","user":{"login":"DarioSamo","id":538504,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzODUwNA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/538504?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo","html_url":"https://github.com/DarioSamo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-20T15:29:59Z","updated_at":"2025-08-20T15:30:37Z","body":"Also breaks in 4.4.1-stable. I reduced the project to just the custom node and cleared the 'export' folder before doing the headless export.\n\n<img width=\"1939\" height=\"563\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/fdd6717a-3188-4525-9806-5ea2b232f358\" />\n\nWe should definitely keep track of it but I don't think we have a single commit to bisect this to. I'll leave my conclusions on it on a bit for whoever wishes to research this further.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3206894891/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3206919775","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109177#issuecomment-3206919775","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109177","id":3206919775,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6_JbZf","user":{"login":"DarioSamo","id":538504,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzODUwNA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/538504?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo","html_url":"https://github.com/DarioSamo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-20T15:37:48Z","updated_at":"2025-08-20T15:37:48Z","body":"The core difference between headless and non-headless export lies on this.\n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/28bd72a7e1146a2de40991033c148f595144079e/servers/rendering/renderer_scene_cull.cpp#L4002\n\nIn both scenarios, the materials array has empty RIDs. In this case, Godot falls back to pulling the right RID from the Rendering Server Mesh Storage. In headless, this uses a Dummy implementation which explicitly doesn't implement that function and returns an empty RID.\n\nI'm not familiar with the code before this bit and why the material RID is unassigned, but that is the core difference between both modes.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3206919775/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]